    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946900/extras/0249019e5fc712051b9093580665e1b8.poster.avif?t=1748721759\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946900/extras/0249019e5fc712051b9093580665e1b8.apng?t=1748721759\" class=\"bb_img\" width=573 height=192 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946900/extras/b2b2bf31839e456c7ccd2c3b170c58f2.poster.avif?t=1748721759\" width=575 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946900/extras/b2b2bf31839e456c7ccd2c3b170c58f2.webm?t=1748721759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Gum Flesh is a turn based roguelike that takes place on the back of a celestial monster. Your ship has crashed and in need of repair. Explore a sticky hostile planet filled with dangers in every fold of flesh. Use your wits and fragile supplies to take on strange fauna and weird plants as you search for missing parts of your ship, on a planet where you are definitely not welcome. There's no one coming. It's up to you to leave this place. </strong><br><br><i>Plants shouldn't shoot fireballs right?</i> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946900/extras/8fb20d898973c297e29a7261acb85b23.poster.avif?t=1748721759\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946900/extras/8fb20d898973c297e29a7261acb85b23.apng?t=1748721759\" class=\"bb_img\" width=575 height=192 /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The air is different here. Your body starts to change. </strong> </h2>Mutate your hands into regenerative stone that cause massive damage while flinging bits of rock in all directions. Sprout a foliage-like hide to gain an advantage while fighting in tall grass. Soak up any electrical current and discharge a massive shock attack. Grow another finger so you can reload your weapons faster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946900/extras/bf5f6687942909f3eab36e462489632f.poster.avif?t=1748721759\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946900/extras/bf5f6687942909f3eab36e462489632f.apng?t=1748721759\" class=\"bb_img\" width=575 height=192 /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>As your ship went down, cargo scattered throughout the clouds.</strong></h2> Explore the surface and recover gadgets and weapons. Some familiar, some alien. From your everyday shotgun and  rifle, to a giant tentacle and fireballs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discover an arsenal of weapons, each with its own unique behaviors<br></li><li>Combine gadgets and items with your mutations to create a new build every run<br></li><li>Face a variety of strange fauna, weird plants, and giant bosses<br></li><li>Learn new abilities: Pick up an enemy with your brain, Call down missiles, Slam the ground to make enemies go flying ,and much more!<br></li><li>Consume gum balls with strange powers<br></li><li>Beware of the Epiglott</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946900/extras/29d79652098e7a8ecf838aeddad59826.poster.avif?t=1748721759\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946900/extras/29d79652098e7a8ecf838aeddad59826.apng?t=1748721759\" class=\"bb_img\" width=575 height=192 /></picture></span>",
